{"product_id":"suicide-squad-vol-4-discipline-and-punish-the-new-52","title":"Suicide Squad Vol. 4: Discipline and Punish (The New 52)","description":"\u003cp\u003eNew team members, new direction, new creative team! After the Suicide Squad is nearly massacred, the team returns to Belle Reve to lick their wounds and bury their dead--but when they find out what's waiting for them at the prison, they'll wish they were back out in the field! Task Force X has a new leader, who will make this team of killers and thieves even deadlier than ever before.From rising writer Ales Kot comes SUICIDE SQUAD VOL. 4: DISCIPLINE AND PUNISH, collecting issues #20-23 as well as the DEADSHOT and HARLEY QUINN Villains Month one-shots.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 168 x 258\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Kot Ales\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781401247010\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45460927250585,"sku":"12RE9781401247010","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6847d91872a19-Suicide-Squad-Vol-4-Discipline-and-Punish-The-New-52-Kot-Ales-_1.jpg?v=1753121508","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/suicide-squad-vol-4-discipline-and-punish-the-new-52","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}